doneproof has no third-party runtime dependencies. The conditions are plain strings and the
engine is the Python standard library only (re, pathlib). Nothing is bundled or vendored.

Extracted from the governed runner at github.com/souzalrns/network-agents-setup
(runner/plan_runner/done_when.py). The runner keeps the glue that binds this engine to its
event log; this package is the standalone, store-agnostic core.
